<!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><div id=\"section-KI-fCuyF5S\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"fullSection noBorder radius0 none c-section c-wrapper section-KI-fCuyF5S mobile-only tablet-hide\"><div class=\"bg bgCover bg-section-KI-fCuyF5S none\" style=\"border-radius:0px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;\"></div><!----><div class=\"inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"row-hrNybuO4YS\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"row-align-center noBorder radius0 none c-row c-wrapper row-hrNybuO4YS\"><!----><!----><div class=\"inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"col-iAnQzkVysz\" data-animation-class=\"\" data-entrance-clip=\"1\" style=\"\" class=\"noBorder radius0 none c-column c-wrapper col-iAnQzkVysz\"><!----><!----><div class=\"vertical inner\"><!----><!--[--><!--[--><div id=\"image-yDT6lfSQQ3\" data-animation-class=\"\" style=\"\" class=\"c-custom-code c-wrapper image-yDT6lfSQQ3\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><span></span><div id=\"image-yDT6lfSQQ3__custom-code\" class=\"custom-code-container cimage-yDT6lfSQQ3\"><!-- \"0% Financing Available\" ribbon banner, coded (no image): navy body with folded ends, dotted inner border, white\n     logo above the headline. scripts/convert.mjs swaps every image element that used the old ribbon PNG for this\n     markup; the headline text node is translated like any other text (\"Financiamiento al 0% Disponible\" on /es).\n     The wrapper is centred, spans the content column up to 620px, sits flush on the section's top edge on every\n     page and breakpoint (see the script), and scales its type with the viewport. -->\n<style>\n  .snz-ribbon {\n    --rb-navy: #0a1a93; --rb-navy-dark: #000b4a; --rb-ear: 7%;\n    position: relative; z-index: 2; width: min(100%, 620px); margin: 0 auto clamp(26px, 7vw, 40px); pointer-events: none; /* bottom margin = space between the ribbon and the headline */\n    transform: translateY(var(--snz-ribbon-shift, 0px));\n    font-family: var(--headlinefont, 'Montserrat', 'Poppins', sans-serif);\n  }\n  /* folded ends: dark tabs at the top corners, wide at the top and tapering down the outer side */\n  .snz-ribbon::before, .snz-ribbon::after {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; top: 0; width: calc(var(--rb-ear) + 2px); height: 42%;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--rb-navy-dark), #001489);\n  }\n  .snz-ribbon::before { left: 0; clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%); }\n  .snz-ribbon::after { right: 0; clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 0 100%); }\n  .snz-ribbon__body {\n    position: relative; margin: 0 var(--rb-ear); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1f9e 0%, #00146f 100%);\n    border-radius: 0 0 clamp(22px, 6vw, 44px) clamp(22px, 6vw, 44px);\n    padding: clamp(8px, 2vw, 12px) clamp(10px, 2.5vw, 14px) clamp(10px, 2.4vw, 14px);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px -14px rgba(0, 10, 60, 0.6);\n  }\n  .snz-ribbon__inner {\n    border: 2px dotted rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); border-top: 0;\n    border-radius: 0 0 clamp(16px, 4.6vw, 34px) clamp(16px, 4.6vw, 34px);\n    padding: clamp(2px, 1vw, 6px) clamp(12px, 3vw, 22px) clamp(10px, 2.6vw, 16px);\n    text-align: center; color: #fff;\n  }\n  .snz-ribbon__logo { display: block; width: clamp(64px, 16vw, 104px); height: auto; margin: 0 auto clamp(2px, 0.8vw, 6px); filter: brightness(0) invert(1); }\n  .snz-ribbon__text { display: block; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(17px, 4.9vw, 32px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-wrap: balance; }\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\n    /* phones: use the whole column (the custom-code container pads 10px each side) */\n    .snz-ribbon { width: calc(100% + 20px); max-width: calc(100vw - 20px); margin-left: -10px; margin-right: -10px; margin-bottom: 30px; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"snz-ribbon\">\n  <div class=\"snz-ribbon__body\">\n    <div class=\"snz-ribbon__inner\">\n      <img class=\"snz-ribbon__logo\" src=\"/assets/lcimg/image/f_webp/q_80/r_1200/u/filesafe/qR8peonBlnjGI3ZuLHQP/media/8d16458d-661d-4d16-bec0-14dea766bf45.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"252\" height=\"80\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <span class=\"snz-ribbon__text\">Financiamiento al 0% Disponible</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!--[--><div id=\"heading-w4G14wephb\" data-animation-class=\"\" style=\"\" class=\"c-heading c-wrapper\" data-animate=\"fade-up\"><!----><!----><!----><div class=\"heading-w4G14wephb text-output cheading-w4G14wephb noBorder radius0 none\" data-animation-class=\"\" style=\"\"><div><h1><strong><span style=\"color: var(--white); font-family: 'customhl-6a7218f28a84cd95ca4e22e1-Visby Extrabold'\">Duerme mejor ahora.</span></strong></h1><h1><strong><span style=\"color: var(--white); font-family: 'customhl-6a7218f28a84cd95ca4e22e1-Visby Extrabold'\">Paga a plazos.</span></strong></h1></div></div><!----><!----><!----><span></span><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---